# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Autonomous SRE Incident Commander — repository ignore rules
#
# Ordering: secrets first (highest consequence), then language toolchains,
# then infrastructure state, then editor/OS noise.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

